      "rationale": "עטה — 'ka fɔ i yɛrɛ kɔnɔ' (masakɛ bɛ dugukolo ta i n'a fɔ a ta yɛrɛ ye): misali min bɔ a nɔ na, Heburukan bɛ o fɔ cogo kelen na ni misibagatigi ye."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "alaw",
      "rationale": "אלהי מצרים — o ye Misira ka batofɛnw ye, Ala tiɲɛnenw tɛ ye; 'alaw' (batofɛnw) ka ɲɛ 'Elohim' ye tiɲɛ Tɔgɔ nɔ na."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Ne bɛ tasuma da Misira alaw so kɔnɔ; a bɛ u lasara, k'u ta ka kɛ jon ye. A bɛ Misira ⟨את⟩ dugukolo ɲɛfɔ i n'a fɔ misibagatigi bɛ ⟨את⟩ a yɛrɛ ɲɛfɔ cogo min; ka bɔ yen hɛrɛ la.",
